flowchart TD
 A["New Enquiry / Existing Customer Request"] --> B["Create or Locate ServiceM8 Job"]
 B --> C["Capture Client, Site Address, Scope, Photos and Plans"]
 C --> D{"Information Complete?"}
 D -- No --> E["Request Missing Details and Set Follow-up"]
 E --> D
 D -- Yes --> F{"Project Fit and Priority"}
 F -- Not Suitable --> G["Record Reason / No Bid"]
 F -- Suitable --> H["Technical Review and Scope Confirmation"]
 H --> I{"Site Measure Required?"}
 I -- Yes --> J["Arrange Site Visit and Verify Conditions"]
 I -- No --> K["Prepare Quotation"]
 J --> K
 K --> L["Issue Quote and Set Next Action"]
 L --> M{"Customer Decision"}
 M -- Revise --> H
 M -- No Response --> N["Scheduled Follow-up / Hold"]
 N --> M
 M -- Declined --> O["Record Lost Reason"]
 M -- Accepted --> P["Confirm Work Order and Payment Terms"]
 P --> Q["Order Materials and Schedule Booking"]
 Q --> R{"Site and Materials Ready?"}
 R -- No --> S["Resolve Blockers / Reschedule"]
 S --> R
 R -- Yes --> T["Installation and Site Records"]
 T --> U{"Quality Check Passed?"}
 U -- No --> V["Rectification / Variation"]
 V --> T
 U -- Yes --> W["Completion Documents / PS3 if Required"]
 W --> X["Invoice and Accounts Follow-up"]
 X --> Y{"Payment Reconciled?"}
 Y -- No --> X
 Y -- Yes --> Z["Close Job / Warranty / Customer Follow-up"]
 subgraph MANAGEMENT["Management and Automation"]
 AA["Job Owner and Next Booking"]
 AB["Missing Information Alerts"]
 AC["Quote Follow-up"]
 AD["Daily Job Status Reporting"]
 end
 B -.-> AA
 E -.-> AB
 L -.-> AC
